    <DataNode elementId="HOMO-CYS" textLabel="L-homocysteine" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="FFFHZYDWPBMWHY-VKHMYHEASA-N" dataSource="InChIKey" />
      <Graphics centerX="1600.0" centerY="832.5984497070312" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="xue, PMN, nilo-poyanco">L-homocysteine is one of the major |FRAME: Protein-bound-uremic-retention-solutes &quot;protein-bound uremic retention solutes&quot;|. At concentrations encountered during uremia L-homocysteine predisposes uremic patients to cardiovascular disease through impairment of endothelial and smooth muscle cell functions.</Comment>
